{'symbol': 'TRV', 'date': '2023-04-26 09:00:00', 'title': 'TRAVELERS INSTITUTE® ANNOUNCES MAY AND JUNE 2023 VIRTUAL PROGRAMMING', 'text': 'HARTFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE TRAVELERS INSTITUTE, THE PUBLIC POLICY DIVISION OF THE TRAVELERS COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: TRV), TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS WEDNESDAYS WITH WOODWARD® VIRTUAL PROGRAMMING SCHEDULE FOR MAY AND JUNE 2023. THE WEBINAR SERIES, HOSTED BY JOAN WOODWARD, PRESIDENT OF THE TRAVELERS INSTITUTE AND EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT OF PUBLIC POLICY AT TRAVELERS, EXAMINES PRESSING TOPICS AT THE INTERSECTION OF INSURANCE, BUSINESS AND PUBLIC POLICY. “OUR LATEST EDUCATIONAL LINEUP COVERS A.'}